    },
    {
     "explanation": "**Constants.**",
     "latex": "\\begin{gathered}B_1=v(0^+)=0 \\\\ -200(0)+979.8\\,B_2=98\\,000\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad B_2=100.02\\ \\mathrm{V}\\end{gathered}"
    },
    {
     "explanation": "**Plug in (c).**",
