     "explanation": "**Constants.**",
     "latex": "\\begin{gathered}A_1+A_2=-10 \\\\ -1000A_1-4000A_2=-150\\,000 \\\\ A_1=-63.33,\\qquad A_2=53.33\\end{gathered}"
