     "latex": "v(t)=-63.33e^{-1000t}+53.33e^{-4000t}\\ \\mathrm{V}"
    }
   ],
   "answer": "(a) $-2\\,\\mathrm{mA}$ (b) $-6\\,\\mathrm{mA}$ (c) $-150\\,000\\,\\mathrm{V/s}$ (d) $v=-63.33e^{-1000t}+53.33e^{-4000t}\\,\\mathrm{V}$",
